msgctxt "80"
msgid ""
"(Because of you, Terada... I learned never to give up on\r\n"
"people, even when things take a turn for the worst.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"(I hope someday the Tojo Clan becomes the kind of\r\n"
"organization you always wanted it to be. Until that day,\r\n"
"watch over them... Please.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"(Terada... You were one of the leaders of a Kansai yakuza\r\n"
"conglomerate known as the Omi Alliance.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"(Despite working for our rivals, you owed Kazama-san\r\n"
"a huge debt, leading you to try and stop the Tojo Clan's\r\n"
"infighting over the missing 10 billion yen.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"(After seeing the kindness and generosity in your heart,\r\n"
"I decided to leave the Tojo Clan in your hands.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"(To protect the weakened Tojo from the Omi Alliance, you\r\n"
"opted to call a truce with their leader, Jin Goda.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"(But it was all part of a plot to take revenge for the\r\n"
"Jingweon massacre from over twenty years earlier.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"(Even so, you owed your life to Kazama-san. That's why\r\n"
"I chose to believe you when you asked me to trust you\r\n"
"as you died.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"(Because of you, Terada... I learned never to give up on\r\n"
"people, even when things take a turn for the worst.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"(I hope someday the Tojo Clan becomes the kind of\r\n"
"organization you always wanted it to be. Until that day,\r\n"
"watch over them... Please.)"
msgstr ""

